 columnspacing=\"0em\" rowspacing=\"0.6em 0.6em 0.6em 0.3em\"><mtr><mtd><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></msup></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></msup></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"INNER\"><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OPEN\">(</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></msup><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\">)</mo></mrow></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"INNER\"><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OPEN\">(</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></msup><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\">)</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Therefore, the correct answer is \"III only\". </p>\n</div></div>",
